| 1 | The status API's body says when the database version reads `unavailable` | [ ] |

## Design

One label in the status API's body changes; the API reads it as before.

### File Manifest

| File | Change | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `modules/site/src/Service/StatusBody.php` | modify | The database field's description |

### Locked-In Decisions

1. Only the label's text changes.

